  "title": "Piernik — Honey Bread",
  "description": "This is a recipe from my Polish grandmother. It is a semi-sweet bread that tastes wonderful with a little butter. I grew up on this stuff and it has always been one of my favorites.",
  "authors": [
    "ZURIELLE"
  ],
